PORT_APPROVAL APPROVED
APPROVED_PORT "7"
APPROVED_PORT "07"
APPROVED_PORT "77"
APPROVED_PORT "777"
APPROVED_PORT "4"

CUTSCENE KeybladeAbilitiesRemoved

SCENE DREAM
Mickey floats down toward Kingdom Key, the black area beneath the white stained-glass structure.
Mickey accidentally drops his Keyblade from above the structure.
A jewelry box appears high in the sky, looming over Mickey.
Heartless appear around him.
Mickey looks scared.
Mickey wakes up. It was a dream.

SCENE TEA
Donald and Goofy arrive later to share a cup of tea with Mickey.
Kairi enters, bows to King Mickey, and hands him an envelope.
King Mickey makes a goofy face.
SPLASH ART APPEARS

SCENE GAMEPLAY INTRO
CUT TO GAMEPLAY
CHARACTERS Sora, Kairi, Mickey
STAGE Kingdom Key
MOVESET Sora, Kairi, Mickey
TITLE APPEARS

SCENE RETURN HOME
King Mickey returns home with his Keyblade.
King Mickey closes the jewelry box with his Keyblade.
END CUTSCENE

AFTER CUTSCENE
DISPLAY_LIMIT USER_KEYBLADE 1
FLAG KEEP_DISPLAYED_KEYBLADE_ABILITY_ONLY
ABILITY_SOURCE USER_DISPLAYED_KEYBLADE
ABILITY_LIMIT USER 1
OPEN COLLECTION

OUTPUT "ONE_DISPLAYED_KEYBLADE_ABILITY"
END
